n- 间数: 4\n- 金额: ¥3,900.00\n\n住宿费超标判断: ¥3900 / 3晚 / 4间 = ¥325/间/晚 > ¥300，超标！\n\n### 2、交通费:\n#### (1) 长途交通费:\n按日期先后逐日统计：\n\n6月22日: 汕头→南昌西, 高铁, 单价¥425, 3张 → 金额¥1,275\n6月25日: 南昌西→汕头, 高铁, 单价¥415, 5张 → 金额¥2,075\n\n#### (2) 市内交通费:\n6月22日: 南昌, ¥18.60 (2笔滴滴: 9.30×2)\n6月25日: 南昌, ¥19.20 (2笔滴滴: 9.60×2)\n\n### 3、其他: 无，不填\n\n### 4、超标项目:\n住宿费超标 (per night per room > ¥300)\n\n### 5、特殊补贴: 不填\n\n### 6、出差补贴: CM.md says \"出差补贴这个表格以及以下的内容不要填写\" - skip this\n\nNow I need to also consider: 市内交通费单程超过100元？No, each is ~¥9-10, far below.\n住宿费每晚超过300元？Yes, ¥325/night/room.\n\nFor the 超标项目 table:\n序号1, 项目: 住宿费, 金额: 3900\n\nWait, the CM.md says:\n\"市内交通费单程超过100元、住宿费每晚超过300元属于超标项目，同时需要填入\"4、超标项目（已报备）\"里，项目写费用类型，不用具体写出原因。例如：\"住宿费\"。\"\n\nSo I should put \"住宿费\" in the 超标项目 column.\n\nBut what amount goes in the 超标项目 金额? Only the excess amount or the full amount? Let me look at the example...\n\nActually the template has:\nE30='4、超标项目（已报备）'\nE31='序号' F31='项  目'\n\nThe columns for 超标项目 are E (序号) and F (项目). There's no金额 column in the 超标项目 section per se. But looking at the template more carefully:\n\nRow 30: A30='3、其他'  E30='4、超标项目（已报备）'\nRow 31: A31='序号'  B31='项目'  C31='金额（元）'  E31='序号'  F31='项  目'\nRow 36: A36='合计'  C36==SUM(C32:C35)\n\nSo the 超标项目 section just has 序号 (E) and 项目 (F) - no金额! The 金额 column (C31) is under 3、其他 section.\n\nSo for 超标项目, I just need to list the item name like \"住宿费\" in column F.\n\nNow let me write the big Python script to copy the template and fill both sheets.\n\nActually, let me first focus on just the 审批表 (Sheet 2), and then do Sheet 1 later.\n\nLet me think carefully about what to fill in:\n\n### 附表一 差旅费审批表:\n\nRow 3: 报销人: 蔡劢\nRow 3 (C): 同行人员: 陈建华, 付汝龙, 张慧仪, 孙伟成\nRow 3 (E): 报销前提: (不填)\nRow 4: 报销日期: 2026年7月2日\nRow 4 (C): 天数: 4\nRow 4 (E): 出差地点: 南昌\n\n#### 1、住宿费 (rows 8-11, 4 rows for data):\nRow 8: 2026.6.22-6.25 | 南昌绿地铂瑞酒店 | 南昌 | 3 | 4 | 3900.00\nRows 9-11: empty/不填\n\n#### 2、交通费 (1) 长途 (rows 16-20, 5 rows for data):\nRow 16: 2026.6.22 | 汕头-南昌西 | 高铁 | 425 | 1275.00 | (备注: 3人)\nRow 17: 2026.6.25 | 南昌西-汕头 | 高铁 | 415 | 2075.00 | (备注: 5人)\nRows 18-20: empty\n\nWait, CM.md says: \"长途交通费和室内交通费按照第二步\"发票明细\"里的日期按照先后顺序逐日进行统计整合填写。其中，\"单价\"表示单张机票/火车票的金额\"\n\nSo each row represents one day's trips. On 6/22 there are 3 tickets at ¥425 each. On 6/25 there are 5 tickets at ¥415 each.\n\nFor \"金额\": should it be total (单价 × number of tickets) or just 单价? Let me re-read: \"单价表示单张机票/火车票的金额\". So:\n- D column (单价): single ticket price\n- E column (金额): total amount for that row\n\nWait, that doesn't make sense. The column labels are: 起止日期 | 起止地点 | 方式 | 单价 | 金额 | 备注.\n\nSo \"单价\" = unit price of each ticket, \"金额\" = total amount. That makes sense: 3 tickets × ¥425 = ¥1,275.\n\nBut wait, the example shows:\nRow 16 in the example template (which is blank). Let me look at the example:\nE21 ==SUM(E16:E20) - so E column is the total amount.\n\nFor 6/22: 3 tickets × ¥425 = ¥1,275 → D16=425, E16=1275\nFor 6/25: 5 tickets × ¥415 = ¥2,075 → D17=415, E17=2075\n\nBut wait, should they be combined into one row per date or one row per ticket? CM.md says \"按照日期先后顺序逐日进行统计整合填写\" - so it's by day.\n\nActually wait, there are only 2 distinct dates (6/22 and 6/25), and they each have different routes. 6/22 = 汕头→南昌西, 6/25 = 南昌西→汕头.\n\nLet me put:\nRow 16: 6.22 | 汕头-南昌西 | 高铁 | 425 | 1275 | 陈建华、张慧仪、孙伟成\nRow 17: 6.25 | 南昌西-汕头 | 高铁 | 415 | 2075 | 蔡劢、陈建华、付汝龙、张慧仪、孙伟成\n\n#### 2、交通费 (2) 市内 (rows 24-28, 5 rows for data):\nRow 24: 6.22 | 南昌 | 18.60 | (天数不填) | (留空/公式) | \nRow 25: 6.25 | 南昌 | 19.20 | (天数不填) | (留空/公式) |\n\nCM.md says: \"市内交通费中的'天数'不要填写\" and \"所在城市填城市名称\"\n\nBut the E column is \"平均每天\" with formula E29=C29/D29. If D (天数) is not filled, this formula breaks. That's probably OK since it says not to fill 天数.\n\n#### 3、其他: empty\n\n#### 4、超标项目:\n住宿费 per night per room = 3900 / 3 / 4 = 325 > 300\n\nRow 32 (or first available): E32=1, F32=住宿费\n\nActually the column for 超标项目 is:\nE31='序号'  F31='项目'\n\nSo:\nE32=1, F32=住宿费\n\nThat's all for 超标项目. No金额.\n\nOK, now let