ot 增值税专用发票. Only the hotel invoice is a 增值税专用发票.\n\nSo K9 = 220.75 (from hotel 专用发票)\nL9 = 税额 from other invoices? The template seems to only have K9 for 进项税额. L9 might be left blank per CM.md.\n\nActually CM.md says: \"K9这一格填写所有专用发票里包括的总税额，L9这一格不用填写\"\n\nSo K9 = 220.75, L9 = (empty)\n\nNow Row 12-15: Trip details\nThe example shows:\nRow 12: headers (起止日期, 起止地点, 天数, ...)\nRow 13: 6.1 | 汕头-南通 | 1 | 6.3-6.4 | 南通-汕头 | 1 | | | 项目号：2025010\nRow 14: 6.2 | 江阴 | 1\nRow 15: 6.3 | 江阴-南通 | 1\n\nFor our trip:\nOur trip is simpler: 汕头→南昌 (6/22) and 南昌→汕头 (6/25). The trip spans 6/22-6/25 (4 days).\n\nRow 13: 6.22 | 汕头-南昌 | 1 | 6.25 | 南昌-汕头 | 1 | | | 项目号：104\nRows 14, 15, 16: empty\n\nActually looking at the template, the merged cell J13:L15 suggests there's a \"备注\" that spans rows 13-15. The example has J13='项目号：2025010'.\n\nOK, let me now write the comprehensive script to:\n1. Copy the template to 差旅费报销审批表-草稿.xlsx\n2. Fill Sheet 2 (附表一)\n3. Fill Sheet 1 (报销单)\n\nThis is going to be a big script. Let me write it to a file first.\n\nActually, let me think about whether I should ask about 出差事由 first. The CM.md doesn't list it as a required question. Let me use something generic like \"南昌出差\" or similar.\n\nAlso for 职务/职称: not asked in CM.md either. Let me leave it blank.\n\nLet me proceed with writing the comprehensive script.","signature":"0deec41f-7a03-4047-8d6f-100dac4e5e39"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":57088,"output_tokens":7346,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"620935bc-16f8-47bf-be78-8d37e94ac5de","timestamp":"2026-07-02T05:48:43.434Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Blackmai","sessionId":"51c56e77-6319-4cd2-